### Plugin Upload Compatibility Cases

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8089
@incompatibleZipFile = D:/IdeaProjects/magic-boot/plugins/demo-plugin-incompatible.zip
@descriptorMismatchZipFile = D:/IdeaProjects/magic-boot/plugins/demo-plugin-mismatch.zip

### TC-COMP-01 runtime version incompatible
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="demo-plugin-incompatible.zip"
Content-Type: application/zip

< {{incompatibleZipFile}}
--WebAppBoundary--

### Expected:
### 1) code = 500
### 2) errorCode = PLUGIN_VERSION_INCOMPATIBLE

###

### TC-COMP-02 manifest and plugin.properties mismatch
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="demo-plugin-mismatch.zip"
Content-Type: application/zip

< {{descriptorMismatchZipFile}}
--WebAppBoundary--

### Expected:
### 1) code = 500
### 2) errorCode = PLUGIN_DESCRIPTOR_MISMATCH
